 <metadata>
  <name>Guelphur Springs 1x20km Loop</name>
  <desc>20km loop to Guelph Lake and back. Mixed trail with asphalt, crushed gravel, single track packed roots and rocks, in the trees.

Head lamp needed from Dusk to Dawn because of tree cover.

Excellent moon night run. </desc>
  <author>
   <name>Kurt (KPH) Hundeck</name>
   <link href="https://www.strava.com/athletes/1281626"/>
  </author>
  <copyright author="OpenStreetMap contributors">
   <year>2020</year>
   <license>https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright</license>
  </copyright>
  <link href="https://www.strava.com/routes/2742411534010610112"/>
 </metadata>
